nal project for Harvard's CS50x, this web application bridges the gap between biological data management and modern software engineering, providing a robust platform for researchers to manage patient data, genomic sequences, and structural protein analysis.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"BioTech LIMS – Painel de Genômica de Precisão","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/3d7cd/BioTech-LIMS.png","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/3a042/BioTech-LIMS.png 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/da592/BioTech-LIMS.png 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/3d7cd/BioTech-LIMS.png 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/9a30e/BioTech-LIMS.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/ab4e6/BioTech-LIMS.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/9a969/BioTech-LIMS.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/f717f/BioTech-LIMS.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/36bb1/BioTech-LIMS.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/32753/BioTech-LIMS.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/4bb4d/BioTech-LIMS.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/a61fe/BioTech-LIMS.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/acb155e639327faa96c6e8613d97d89c/3b7f9/BioTech-LIMS.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":345.99999999999994}}},"tech":["Django","Python3","HTMX","Bootstrap5","BioPython","Mol*"],"github":"https://github.com/igorfcfs/BioTech","external":"https://biotech-imu0.onrender.com/","cta":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0BzivfHgvN0","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p><strong>BioTech LIMS</strong> é um sistema de alta performance para Gestão de Informações Laboratoriais (LIMS), desenvolvido especificamente para bioinformática clínica e pesquisa genômica. Criada como projeto final do CS50x de Harvard, esta aplicação web faz a ponte entre a gestão de dados biológicos e a engenharia de software moderna, oferecendo uma plataforma robusta para pesquisadores administrarem dados de pacientes, sequências genômicas e análises estruturais de proteínas.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Nexus Evolution Academy","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/03797/code.png","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9051f/code.png 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/b2c0b/code.png 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/03797/code.png 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/a4321/code.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/2f9bd/code.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/56394/code.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/e53cd/code.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/6bbde/code.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9b040/code.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/18cc4/code.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9ed34/code.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/10d45/code.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":373}}},"tech":["React","Java","SpringBoot","JWT Auth","Stripe","Brevo","GenAI"],"github":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/Nexus-Evolution-Academy","external":"#","cta":null,"lang":null},"html":"<p>A full-stack <strong>online learning platform</strong> built to handle user authentication, paid courses, and automated communication in a production-ready environment. The platform combines a React frontend with a <strong>Java + Spring Boot</strong> backend, featuring <strong>JWT-based authentication</strong>, Stripe-powered payments, and transactional email automation via Brevo.</p>\n<p>The system was designed with scalability and security in mind, applying <strong>REST API</strong> best practices, clean architecture, and reliable payment workflows. <strong>GenAI</strong> features were integrated to support intelligent platform capabilities and future personalization. The project reflects real-world backend engineering challenges, including secure auth flows, payment lifecycle management, and maintainable domain modeling.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Nexus Evolution Academy","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/03797/code.png","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9051f/code.png 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/b2c0b/code.png 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/03797/code.png 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/a4321/code.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/2f9bd/code.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/56394/code.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/e53cd/code.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/6bbde/code.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9b040/code.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/18cc4/code.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/9ed34/code.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/be6cc95b984d08bcb2e89a05936bc560/10d45/code.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":373}}},"tech":["React","Java","SpringBoot","JWT Auth","Stripe","Brevo","GenAI"],"github":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/Nexus-Evolution-Academy","external":"#","cta":null,"lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Uma <strong>plataforma de aprendizado online</strong> full-stack construída para lidar com autenticação de usuários, cursos pagos e comunicação automatizada em um ambiente de produção. A plataforma combina um frontend React com um backend <strong>Java + Spring Boot</strong>, apresentando <strong>autenticação baseada em JWT</strong>, pagamentos via Stripe e automação de e-mails transacionais via Brevo.</p>\n<p>O sistema foi projetado com foco em escalabilidade e segurança, aplicando boas práticas de <strong>API REST</strong>, arquitetura limpa e fluxos de pagamento confiáveis. Recursos de <strong>IA Generativa (GenAI)</strong> foram integrados para suporte inteligente na plataforma. O projeto reflete desafios reais de engenharia de backend, incluindo fluxos de autenticação seguros e modelagem de domínio sustentável.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"ECOTECH – Smart E-Waste Recycling System","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/bc3b9/ecotech.png","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/9a130/ecotech.png 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/a3fa1/ecotech.png 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/bc3b9/ecotech.png 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/87926/ecotech.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/dae43/ecotech.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/d7667/ecotech.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/7ec1a/ecotech.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/71a30/ecotech.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/5d873/ecotech.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/26a00/ecotech.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/f23f0/ecotech.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/2c2d0/ecotech.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["React Native","Node.js","Express","Firebase","IoT","Geolocation","GenAI"],"github":"https://github.com/igorfcfs/EcoTechAPI","external":"https://github.com/igorfcfs/EcoTech","cta":"https://pt.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7414112644598497280?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_flagship3_profile_view_base_projects_details%3BelR2hzzXRvS2GJYPqf%2F4rA%3D%3D","lang":null},"html":"<p>A <strong>smart sustainability system (App + Intelligent Bin)</strong> that connects <strong>IoT-enabled e-waste bins</strong> with an <strong>app</strong> to track electronic waste disposal in real time. Users are identified via CPF, earn points based on waste category and weight, and can view recycling history, analytics, and nearby collection points. We guarantee the profit by an Artificial Inteligence integrated in the <strong>Node.js API</strong> that analyses the <strong>picture captured by the bin's camera</strong> and the <strong>weight</strong>. The system processes sensor data, supports <strong>offline synchronization</strong>, and promotes responsible recycling through data-driven insights.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"ECOTECH – Sistema Inteligente de Reciclagem","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/bc3b9/ecotech.png","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/9a130/ecotech.png 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/a3fa1/ecotech.png 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/bc3b9/ecotech.png 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/87926/ecotech.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/dae43/ecotech.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/d7667/ecotech.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/7ec1a/ecotech.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/71a30/ecotech.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/5d873/ecotech.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/26a00/ecotech.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/f23f0/ecotech.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/867585297ce5a715d2f0f63ae85f0db7/2c2d0/ecotech.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["React Native","Node.js","Express","Firebase","IoT","Geolocalização","GenAI"],"github":"https://github.com/igorfcfs/EcoTechAPI","external":"https://github.com/igorfcfs/EcoTech","cta":"https://pt.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7414112644598497280?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_flagship3_profile_view_base_projects_details%3BelR2hzzXRvS2GJYPqf%2F4rA%3D%3D","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Um <strong>sistema de sustentabilidade inteligente (App + Lixeira Inteligente)</strong> que conecta <strong>lixeiras IoT</strong> com um <strong>app</strong> para rastrear o descarte de lixo eletrônico em tempo real. Os usuários são identificados via CPF, ganham pontos com base na categoria e peso do resíduo, e podem visualizar histórico de reciclagem e pontos de coleta próximos.</p>\n<p>Garantimos a monetização através de uma <strong>Inteligência Artificial</strong> integrada na API que analisa a <strong>imagem capturada pela câmera da lixeira</strong> e o <strong>peso</strong>. O sistema processa dados de sensores, suporta <strong>sincronização offline</strong> e promove a reciclagem responsável através de insights baseados em dados.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"SAGE - Sistema de Gestão e Automação Escolar","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/1c89a/SAGE.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/a9efa/SAGE.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/4bdfd/SAGE.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/1c89a/SAGE.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/30dfb/SAGE.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/f30ea/SAGE.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/83eed/SAGE.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/21ab0/SAGE.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/adbff/SAGE.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/4d6f8/SAGE.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":329}}},"tech":["Node.js","Express","JavaScript","MySQL","REST API","Autenticação JWT"],"github":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/SAGE-API","external":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/SAGE","cta":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/igor-fernando-casita_v%C3%ADdeo-pitch-sage-etec-de-tabo%C3%A3o-da-serra-activity-7414117809028333568-fABj?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAADZ4gjIBMGqOEJwo1Po4c2BZ27ajfmptQfk","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>O SAGE é um <strong>sistema de gestão escolar</strong> full-stack construído para lidar com <strong>processos acadêmicos e administrativos</strong>, incluindo gerenciamento de alunos e funcionários, controle de frequência, horários de aulas e relatórios. Foi desenvolvido com uma arquitetura modular para garantir escalabilidade, manutenibilidade e integração perfeita com a infraestrutura escolar existente.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"SAGE - Shool Automation and Management System","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/1c89a/SAGE.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/a9efa/SAGE.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/4bdfd/SAGE.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/1c89a/SAGE.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/30dfb/SAGE.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/f30ea/SAGE.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/83eed/SAGE.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/21ab0/SAGE.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/adbff/SAGE.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/6ef14904bf3f06be634c3f9f17b75c5d/4d6f8/SAGE.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":329}}},"tech":["Node.js","Express","JavaScript","MySQL","REST API","JWT Authentication"],"github":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/SAGE-API","external":"https://github.com/Nexus-Evolution-Tech/SAGE","cta":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/igor-fernando-casita_v%C3%ADdeo-pitch-sage-etec-de-tabo%C3%A3o-da-serra-activity-7414117809028333568-fABj?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAADZ4gjIBMGqOEJwo1Po4c2BZ27ajfmptQfk","lang":null},"html":"<p>SAGE is a full-stack <strong>school management system</strong> built to handle <strong>academic and administrative processes</strong>, including student and staff management, attendance control, class schedules, and reporting. It was developed with a modular architecture to ensure scalability, maintainability, and seamless integration with existing school infrastructure.</p>"}}]}}}